{"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"3. 정답을 기록한다"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"튜토리얼","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-1-Mock-Hand","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"],"title":"튜토리얼"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-3-Reference-Poses","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"heading","text":"3.1","anchor":"31","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"여기가 원래 설계 문서가 통째로 비워 둔 자리입니다.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" “숙련자 포즈를 등록한다”고만 하고 방법이 없으면 아무도 다음 단계로 못 갑니다. 그래서 기록 화면을 튜토리얼 한 단계로 만듭니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 33–40행"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["final class ReferenceLibrary {","    static let shared = ReferenceLibrary()","","    private(set) var table: [Jamo: PoseFeature] = [:]","    \/\/\/ 실측으로 교체된 자모. 자리표시자와 구분한다.","    private(set) var measured: Set<Jamo> = []","","    init() {"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"3.2","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"32"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"같은 글자를 여러 벌 기록해 평균을 냅니다. 그리고 "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관절별 표준편차를 함께 돌려줍니다."}]},{"text":" 이 값의 두 배가 초기 허용 오차가 됩니다 — 허용 오차를 감으로 정하지 않는 방법입니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"관련 코드 — ","type":"text"},{"code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 56–81행","type":"text"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    func register(_ jamo: Jamo, samples: [PoseFeature]) -> (mean: PoseFeature, stdDev: [Float])? {","        guard !samples.isEmpty else { return nil }","        let n = Float(samples.count)","","        var bend = [Float](repeating: 0, count: PoseFeature.bendCount)","        var spread = [Float](repeating: 0, count: PoseFeature.spreadCount)","        var palm = SIMD3<Float>.zero","        for s in samples {","            for i in 0..<PoseFeature.bendCount { bend[i] += s.bend[i] }","            for i in 0..<PoseFeature.spreadCount { spread[i] += s.spread[i] }","            palm += s.palmNormal","        }","        bend = bend.map { $0 \/ n }","        spread = spread.map { $0 \/ n }","        palm = length(palm) > 1e-5 ? normalize(palm) : SIMD3(0, 0, 1)","","        let stdDev = (0..<PoseFeature.bendCount).map { i -> Float in","            let v = samples.reduce(Float(0)) { $0 + pow($1.bend[i] - bend[i], 2) } \/ n","            return sqrt(v)","        }","","        let mean = PoseFeature(bend: bend, spread: spread, palmNormal: palm)","        table[jamo] = mean","        measured.insert(jamo)","        confusableCache = nil","        return (mean, stdDev)"]},{"type":"heading","text":"3.3","anchor":"33","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"사람이 읽고 고칠 수 있는 형태로도 기준 포즈를 적을 수 있게 해 둡니다. curl 0은 완전히 편 손가락, 1은 완전히 접은 손가락입니다. 실측 데이터가 없는 자모를 임시로 채울 때 씁니다."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 6–24행"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct PoseRecipe: Sendable {","    var curl: [Float]              \/\/ 손가락 5개","    var spread: [Float]            \/\/ 인접 4쌍, 0 = 붙임, 1 = 최대로 벌림","    var palm: SIMD3<Float>         \/\/ 손목 기준 손바닥 법선","","    func feature() -> PoseFeature {","        \/\/ 손가락 하나의 굽힘은 뿌리·중간·끝에 각각 다르게 실린다.","        let weight: [Float] = [0.9, 1.1, 1.0]","        let maxBend: Float = 1.5   \/\/ 라디안. 완전히 접은 관절의 굽힘각.","        var bend: [Float] = []","        for c in curl {","            for w in weight { bend.append(clampf(c, 0, 1) * maxBend * w) }","        }","        let maxSpread: Float = 0.45","        return PoseFeature(bend: bend,","                           spread: spread.map { clampf($0, 0, 1) * maxSpread },","                           palmNormal: normalize(palm))","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"34","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"3.4"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"‘ㄱ’을 다섯 벌 기록하고 평균을 내 봅니다. 표준편차가 도 단위로 나오면 3단계 성공입니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관련 코드 — "},{"code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 6–24행"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct PoseRecipe: Sendable {","    var curl: [Float]              \/\/ 손가락 5개","    var spread: [Float]            \/\/ 인접 4쌍, 0 = 붙임, 1 = 최대로 벌림","    var palm: SIMD3<Float>         \/\/ 손목 기준 손바닥 법선","","    func feature() -> PoseFeature {","        \/\/ 손가락 하나의 굽힘은 뿌리·중간·끝에 각각 다르게 실린다.","        let weight: [Float] = [0.9, 1.1, 1.0]","        let maxBend: Float = 1.5   \/\/ 라디안. 완전히 접은 관절의 굽힘각.","        var bend: [Float] = []","        for c in curl {","            for w in weight { bend.append(clampf(c, 0, 1) * maxBend * w) }","        }","        let maxSpread: Float = 0.45","        return PoseFeature(bend: bend,","                           spread: spread.map { clampf($0, 0, 1) * maxSpread },","                           palmNormal: normalize(palm))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"실행 결과"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3단계를 마치면 나오는 화면","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"step3.jpg"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS 26.2 시뮬레이터에서 직접 캡처","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8","text":"체크포인트","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4","type":"heading","text":"여기까지 하면","level":4},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"기록 벌 수가 올라간다"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"평균을 내면 관절별 표준편차 15개가 나온다"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"안 되면 확인할 것","anchor":"%EC%95%88-%EB%90%98%EB%A9%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%A0-%EA%B2%83","level":4},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"가짜 손은 떨림이 작아서 표준편차가 0.2~0.4° 수준으로 나옵니다. 진짜 손은 훨씬 큽니다 — 그래서 실측이 필요합니다.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"%EA%B3%84%EC%86%8D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"계속하기"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"채점을 하려면 정답이 있어야 합니다. 그 정답을 만드는 화면을 먼저 만듭니다.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://JihwaTutor/documentation/JihwaTutor/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide":{"kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/jihwatutor\/step-6-device-tracking-and-guide","type":"topic","title":"6. 실기기: 진짜 손과 3D 가이드","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking